 Help  ([F] the full guide  [esc] close)  ~ means stale

look (plain keys)
  1-8          views
  tab          focus: nav, main, log (esc: back to the nav)
  [ ] .        tree, activity log, activity drawer
  ? :          help; take a command
  x            actions menu for the selected item
  esc          back
  q ctrl+c     quit; ctrl+c quits at once
  g i          setup guide; invite a box (one line to run on it)
  arrows/hjkl  move; left and right switch tabs
  enter /      open; filter
  d            answer the selected job's question
  r            reload
change (Ctrl chords)
  ctrl+t       take over a job whose controller went silent
  ctrl+n       start a job on a box



